          "translation": "Cajado S\u00f4nico"
        },
        "fr": {
          "original": "Sonic Staff",
          "translation": "B\u00e2ton sonique"
        }
      }
    },
    "description": {
      "text": "Trondson's trusty Sonic Staff acts as a multi-purpose tool and weapon. <BINDING_CAST1> fires pulses of destructive sonic energy while <BINDING_CAST2> heals nearby allies.",
      "data": {
        "ru": {
          "original": "Trondson's trusty Sonic Staff acts as a multi-purpose tool and weapon. <BINDING_CAST1> fires pulses of destructive sonic energy while <BINDING_CAST2> briefly detects all enemies around Trondson.",
          "translation": "\u041d\u0430\u0434\u0435\u0436\u043d\u044b\u0439 \u0441\u0432\u0435\u0440\u0445\u0437\u0432\u0443\u043a\u043e\u0432\u043e\u0439 \u043f\u043e\u0441\u043e\u0445 Trondson \u0434\u0435\u0439\u0441\u0442\u0432\u0443\u0435\u0442 \u043a\u0430\u043a \u043c\u043d\u043e\u0433\u043e\u0446\u0435\u043b\u0435\u0432\u043e\u0439 \u0438\u043d\u0441\u0442\u0440\u0443\u043c\u0435\u043d\u0442, \u0430 \u0442\u0430\u043a\u0436\u0435 \u043a\u0430\u043a \u043e\u0440\u0443\u0436\u0438\u0435. <BINDING_CAST1> \u2014 \u0441\u043e\u0437\u0434\u0430\u043d\u0438\u0435 \u0438\u043c\u043f\u0443\u043b\u044c\u0441\u043e\u0432 \u0440\u0430\u0437\u0440\u0443\u0448\u0438\u0442\u0435\u043b\u044c\u043d\u043e\u0439 \u0437\u0432\u0443\u043a\u043e\u0432\u043e\u0439 \u044d\u043d\u0435\u0440\u0433\u0438\u0438, <BINDING_CAST2> \u2014 \u043c\u0433\u043d\u043e\u0432\u0435\u043d\u043d\u043e\u0435 \u043e\u0431\u043d\u0430\u0440\u0443\u0436\u0435\u043d\u0438\u0435 \u0432\u0441\u0435\u0445 \u0432\u0440\u0430\u0433\u043e\u0432 \u043f\u043e\u0431\u043b\u0438\u0437\u043e\u0441\u0442\u0438 \u043e\u0442 \u043f\u043e\u0441\u043e\u0445\u0430."
        },
        "es": {
          "original": "Trondson's trusty Sonic Staff acts as a multi-purpose tool and weapon. <BINDING_CAST1> fires pulses of destructive sonic energy while <BINDING_CAST2> briefly detects all enemies around Trondson.",
          "translation": "<BINDING_CAST1> para disparar. <BINDING_CAST2> para detectar todos los enemigos cercanos."
        },
        "de": {
          "original": "Trondson's trusty Sonic Staff acts as a multi-purpose tool and weapon. <BINDING_CAST1> fires pulses of destructive sonic energy while <BINDING_CAST2> briefly detects all enemies around Trondson.",
          "translation": "Trondsons treuer Schallstab ist gleichzeitig Werkzeug und Waffe. Feuer zerst\u00f6rerische Schallenergie ab (<BINDING_CAST1>) oder finde f\u00fcr kurze Zeit alle Feinde um Trondson herum (<BINDING_CAST2>)."
        },
        "pt": {
          "original": "Trondson's trusty Sonic Staff acts as a multi-purpose tool and weapon. <BINDING_CAST1> fires pulses of destructive sonic energy while <BINDING_CAST2> briefly detects all enemies around Trondson.",
          "translation": "O Cajado S\u00f4nico de Trondson atua como ferramenta e arma multiuso. <BINDING_CAST1> dispara pulsos de energia destrutiva, enquanto <BINDING_CAST2> brevemente detecta todos os inimigos ao redor de Trondson."
        },
        "fr": {
          "original": "Trondson's trusty Sonic Staff acts as a multi-purpose tool and weapon. <BINDING_CAST1> fires pulses of destructive sonic energy while <BINDING_CAST2> briefly detects all enemies around Trondson.",
          "translation": "Le fid\u00e8le b\u00e2ton sonique de Trondson lui sert \u00e0 la fois d'outil polyvalent et d'arme. Son action principale (<BINDING_CAST1>) d\u00e9gage une onde d'\u00e9nergie sonique destructrice tandis que son action secondaire (<BINDING_CAST2>) d\u00e9tecte bri\u00e8vement tous les ennemis \u00e0 proximit\u00e9 de Trondson."
        }
      }
    },
